{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_5_036rui_1_5_036_04",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:65592b1ef6033340c69326e77ecd9f3222edaf5c771a2a43ed3057f566491ef1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_036rui_1_5_036_04:1_5_036_04:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_036rui_1_5_036_04:1_5_036_04:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_036rui_1_5_036_04:1_5_036_04:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_036rui_1_5_036_04:1_5_036_04:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbc8b819a75999cf21ae46a4144ba0e004d20509eb7555827a5e560ba8e78614",
      "text": "时尚杂志写真拍摄的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_036rui_1_5_036_04:1_5_036_04:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e485a0e585baeed89a17d99cd5fd73cba5b526b84db4867d45fdb99f78012080",
      "text": "啊哈哈，thank you！\n不过接下来我会摆出更帅气的造型哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_036rui_1_5_036_04:1_5_036_04:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d2874eb4ef0b9d3a8b0d2faaa5840e7a96c010f91435ebfcc6afeeb425dfc04",
      "text": "回眸瞬间……摆出招牌姿势！\n怎么样？拍得帅吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_036rui_1_5_036_04:1_5_036_04:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:053876ad8fac6748f28e4280bfb4c324af6421204e14e8b5f3aeea23cfc65d58",
      "text": "Wonderful！\n接下来是可爱的姿势？OK，包在我身上！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_036rui_1_5_036_04:1_5_036_04:cmd-000072:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b778da12e44b043eb3a21bef897722f6e5014accfaf2495bacec6def645c7bcf",
      "text": "拍摄后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_036rui_1_5_036_04:1_5_036_04:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:992cbba4d7a6d6c3291cf937009c0f4151635a6c7b53fbe7ddd6f678897f75ce",
      "text": "类先生，辛苦了。\n每张照片都很有类先生的风格，拍得真好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_036rui_1_5_036_04:1_5_036_04:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bdb92d049215cae760e565bcd6e9c692e4bc49caa6ea633b6ce46af4ad84f279",
      "text": "摄影师是个非常讲究细节的人，\n所以拍摄时间拉得很长，您还好吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_036rui_1_5_036_04:1_5_036_04:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0d62020347ea0ca4a63aa0c071d652d3766e5221d312eab292a5c88b501bbfd",
      "text": "No problem！\n是次超级开心的拍摄呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_036rui_1_5_036_04:1_5_036_04:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ff904dfc41e36d44e47ebb966c3be68188390a858bc0e206a446dfca0a45b14",
      "text": "既能穿到各种各样的衣服，\n我也very satisfied！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_036rui_1_5_036_04:1_5_036_04:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed4b63f45998087938f78d76b155f5333f3111eb7b4441a7a6d76cc0866c0481",
      "text": "呐，●●●●プロデューサー酱也\n一起来拍张照吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_036rui_1_5_036_04:1_5_036_04:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04d81d478a0b3e0a3c39de35db422e61e5f74bb5ac02080db0f00a65d2c54fc2",
      "text": "诶，我也要拍吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_036rui_1_5_036_04:1_5_036_04:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa34bda1bd34d9b240100045433415460869154a191f93be57a2e9da7197bfd8",
      "text": "Yes！就当是今天的纪念。\n再去叫上其他工作人员，大家一起拍吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
